e\nMobile Data Enabled: Yes\nData Roaming Enabled: No\nWi-Fi Radio: OFF\nWi-Fi Connected: No","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":37,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-16T11:55:14.609870","tool_call_id":"call_30oa6crm8qtTAcxGXVSf4pC7","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":37,"usage":null},{"content":"Here are the results from the network status check:\n\n- Airplane Mode: OFF\n- SIM Card Status: active\n- Cellular Connection: no service\n- Cellular Signal: none\n- Cellular Network Type: none\n- Mobile Data Enabled: Yes\n- Data Roaming Enabled: No\n- Wi-Fi is off and not connected\n\nWhat should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":38,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-16T11:55:16.027356","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":38,"usage":{"completion_tokens":76,"prompt_tokens":3191}},{"content":"Since your phone shows no cellular connection or signal despite the SIM being active and mobile data enabled, let's check your network mode preference. Sometimes, if the phone is set to an older network mode like 2G or 3G, it can cause no service issues.\n\nPlease perform the \"check_network_mode_preference\" diagnostic action on your phone and share the result with me. This will tell us what network mode your phone is currently set to.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":39,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-16T11:55:18.036946","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":39,"usage":{"completion_tokens":40,"prompt_tokens":7985}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":40,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-16T11:55:19.032049","tool_call_id":null,"tool_cal